,"source_cn":"这枚勋章在战死后都还贴在他的心口，一定是极为看重的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF12D8120FB69C44C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322225005:1":{"text":"これらの証拠をカレリーナさんに持って行ってあげましょう！","source_cn":"我们快把这些证据带回给卡列琳娜吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02D8123355FF095E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13222260.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222260","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222260","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322226001:1":{"text":"こんなにたくさんの証拠が……本当にありがとうございます。","source_cn":"你们能找来这么多证据真是太好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB591DE5C7932DE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322226002:1":{"text":"これなら十分戦士たちの身分を証明できます。中には子孫が生き残っている一族もいるかもしれません。","source_cn":"这些东西能够证明战士们的身份，说不定有依旧存续的姓氏能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB71A94A4041EA154","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322226003:1":{"text":"人々の考えを変えるのはまだ無理かもしれませんが、とても有力な証拠です。","source_cn":"虽然不足以彻底颠覆人们的认知，但已经